# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ThyroCare — Development / Local
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the ThyroCare backend API.
# The src/services/api.js resolver strips any trailing /api segment
# before appending /api, so you may set the full origin here or
# just the origin.  Both of the following work identically:
#
#  VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#  VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# In production replace the hostname/IP/port with your deployed
# API endpoint, e.g.:
#  VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://thyrocare-api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000